<section class="hero"><div class="wrap"><div class="grid">
<div>
<span class="pillbadge">AI-powered business naming</span>
<h1 class="hero-h">The name is just <span class="g nw">the beginning.</span></h1>
<p class="hero-sub">SparkMyName helps entrepreneurs, founders, and side hustlers launch with confidence. Say one sentence and get <b>six complete brands</b> — and everything you need to make one real.</p>
<ul class="hero-checks">
<li><b>✓</b> Six names, logos &amp; checked domains</li>
<li><b>✓</b> Workspace with tools to launch</li>
<li><b>✓</b> Guidance every step of the way</li>
<li><b>✓</b> One flat price. No surprises.</li>
</ul>
<p class="price-line"><span class="mid-dot"><b>$99</b>, one time</span> · <span class="mid-dot">no subscription</span> · <span class="mid-dot">yours forever</span></p>
<div class="sparkcard" id="idea">
<div class="lbl">Say it or type it — one sentence, in your own words</div>
<div class="spark-in">
<textarea aria-label="Describe your business idea in one sentence" id="seed" placeholder="e.g. a cozy wood-fired pizza &amp; wine bar in my town"></textarea>
<button aria-label="Tap and speak your idea" class="mic" id="mic" type="button">
<svg fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" viewbox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 1a3 3 0 0 0-3 3v8a3 3 0 0 0 6 0V4a3 3 0 0 0-3-3z"></path><path d="M19 10v2a7 7 0 0 1-14 0v-2"></path><line x1="12" x2="12" y1="19" y2="23"></line><line x1="8" x2="16" y1="19" y2="19"></line></svg>
            Speak
          </button>
</div>
<p class="mic-hint">Tap <b>Speak</b> and just talk — or type. Take your time; it waits for you.</p>
<div class="trust">
<span><b>✓</b> Six brands, not one</span>
<span><b>✓</b> Delivered same day</span>
<span><b>✓</b> Yours forever</span>
</div>
<a class="btn lg block go" data-checkout="" href="checkout.html">Build my brand — $99</a>
</div>
</div>
<div class="hero-right">
<div class="floatchip"><span class="fc-ic">✓</span>Trusted by entrepreneurs starting something great.</div>
<div class="hero-carousel"><div class="track">
<div class="hcard"><img alt="Romanesco Delight restaurant brand" height="540" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" src="img/romanesco-still.webp" width="960"/><span class="cap"><b>Romanesco Delight</b> · Restaurant</span></div>
