<section class="section" id="what"><div class="wrap">
<div class="sec-head">
<div class="sec-kicker">What you get</div>
<h2>You don’t get one name. <span class="g nw">You get the whole brand.</span></h2>
<p>Say one sentence and all of this is built fresh around your idea — and it keeps growing, because one engine makes every piece.</p>
</div>
<div class="dgrid dgrid-6">
<div class="dcard"><div class="dimg"><img src="img/grid-01-names.webp" alt="Six gold-foiled name cards, logo suite and brand style guide for The Penthouse Suite laid out on white marble" width="1200" height="800" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></div><b>Six names, ranked best-first.</b><span>Enter your idea once. Spark&rsquo;s engine returns six complete, distinct brand names scored best-first, each with its <b>.com and .net checked live</b> &mdash; plus alternative endings to claim &mdash; so you can secure your exact digital home.</span></div>
<div class="dcard"><div class="dimg"><img src="img/grid-02-logos.webp" alt="A complete vector logo suite presentation sheet: primary emblem, square icon and dark-background lockup" width="1200" height="800" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></div><b>A full logo suite, ready to print.</b><span>Every name comes with a complete, multi-format vector logo package &mdash; <b>primary lockup, icon, wordmark, emblem and outline</b> &mdash; built so a printer or designer can build anything from day one.</span></div>
<div class="dcard"><div class="dimg"><img src="img/grid-03-colors.webp" alt="A brand style guide open to its color palette, typography scale and brand voice attributes" width="1200" height="800" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></div><b>Colors, fonts &amp; strategic voice.</b><span>Never stare at a blank screen again. Every brand includes <b>three curated color palettes</b> with HEX codes, professional heading-and-body font pairings, and a complete voice and tone direction guide.</span></div>
<div class="dcard"><div class="dimg"><img src="img/grid-04-copy.webp" alt="An open notebook of social media bios and tagline options beside a tablet showing launch announcements" width="1200" height="800" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></div><b>Taglines, bios &amp; ready-to-post copy.</b><span>Instant marketing readiness. You get <b>six distinct taglines</b>, short-and-long social bios, ready-to-use LinkedIn and Facebook intros, and pre-written launch posts customized to your exact business.</span></div>
<div class="dcard"><div class="dimg"><img src="img/grid-05-successpath.webp" alt="An open strategy journal showing The Success Path launch checklist beside a laptop of business milestones" width="1200" height="800" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></div><b>The Success Path &amp; Launch Map.</b><span>A clear, step-by-step roadmap that takes you from a brand on screen to a business in the real world. Follow an orderly sequence to <b>secure your domain, connect your socials</b>, and put your deliverables to work.</span></div>
<div class="dcard"><div class="dimg"><img src="img/grid-06-workspace.webp" alt="A laptop showing the SparkMyName workspace dashboard surrounded by branded merchandise" width="1200" height="800" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></div><b>A living workspace + 8 AI tools.</b><span>Your brand lives in a powerful digital workspace equipped with <b>8 custom AI tools</b> &mdash; Brand Assistant, Content Studio, Logo Lab, Name Engine, Market Pulse, Brand Health, Voice Tuner and Image Studio &mdash; that already know your brand inside and out.</span></div>
</div>
<p class="center" style="margin-top:34px"><a class="btn ghost" href="what-you-get.html">See everything the engine makes →</a></p>
</div></section>
